{
  "bodyHash": "ydQ4Naiyjno=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">营火重生与调整模组提供了在营火中设置重生点的功能，并对该方块的相关机制进行了一些更改。默认情况下，你复活时会获得 10 秒的抗火效果，并且会出现在营火上方。该功能在主世界、下界和末地中均有效，同时也适用于模组添加的维度。<br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>默认配置下的功能：</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">营火初始为熄灭状态。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">点燃营火会在其上方创建一个重生点。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">使用沙子、泥土或灵魂沙右键点击营火可将其熄灭。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">用水下营火时，使用打火石右键点击可去除水浸状态。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">防止在营火侧面点击时在相邻方块上放置火焰。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">如果玩家在营火内重生，将获得 10 秒的抗火效果。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">复活时如果营火上方有方块，会生成一个两格高的空气空间。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">潜行 + 右键点击床会覆盖营火重生点。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">潜行 + 右键点击营火会移除重生点。或者在点燃时潜行点击，可防止设置重生点。</span></span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于《原版体验》整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 RPG 捆绑包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfiresStartUnlit</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，新放置的营火将是熄灭状态。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sneakRightClickCampfireToUnset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">潜行 + 右键点击营火可取消营火重生点。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>bedsOverrideCampfireSpawn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，在床上睡觉会覆盖营火重生点。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createAirPocketIfBlocksAboveCampfire</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，如果重生时营火上方被堵塞，模组会破坏营火上方的方块。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnNewCampfireSpawnSet</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，每当设置新的营火重生点时，会向玩家发送一条消息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnUnset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，每当取消营火重生点时，会向玩家发送一条消息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnMissing</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，每当复活时营火重生点缺失，会向玩家发送一条消息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnOverride</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，每当营火重生点被 PlayerSetSpawnEvent 覆盖时，会向玩家发送一条消息。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>fireResitanceDurationOnRespawnInMs</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 10000，最小值 0，最大值 3600000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家在营火处复活时抗火效果的持续时间。值为 0 则会禁用此功能，并改为将玩家放置在营火旁边。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">放置和破坏营火，以设置和取消重生点：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在营火上放置泥土以将其熄灭：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"552\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在营火处复活：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">从下界在下界内复活：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">从主世界复活到下界：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用打火石点燃营火以去除水浸状态：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/g.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组，只要下载链接仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论区已关闭，因为我无法在众多模组页面中跟踪所有评论。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事项，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
